{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "f6a94bc238ff1ec61a9758f36b55ea0cdfc7a3daf94f83a465687c45b514dc56", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nお昼ご飯、もう食べましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，工作辛苦了！\n你吃过午饭了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
