{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "9e01cc8021b098ea173001071aa399eaf1e5dc75553b5625dc126f9775bc2d8a", "ja": "それならよかったです！\n用意したので、よかったら食べてください！", "zh": "这样正好！\n我帮你准备好了，不嫌弃就请用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "22bfa22a2079ba4e5a773a30f48c6b25850dd891a57f05a3d07b92746047f904", "ja": "今日のメインディッシュは、特製の油淋鶏ですよ～！\n春雨サラダに、トマトと卵のスープもありますからね。", "zh": "今天的主菜是特制油淋鸡～！\n还有冬粉沙拉跟番茄蛋花汤喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "08b3a6d87fb512370eadf36f6c2883b74f4c56a16e9b86d484d9d39602467ba9", "ja": "足りなかったら、餃子も焼きますから！\nお腹いっぱい食べちゃってくださいね♪", "zh": "要是份量不够的话，我可以再煎个煎饺！\n请你一定要吃得饱饱的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "782532cfbacacad68d8993d0a78fc45465cc63690f2f2fa4784deb49f41fe889", "ja": "ありがとう。というか、すごく本格的なんだな。\n劇場の給湯室で、そんな料理ができるものなのか？", "zh": "谢谢你。不过还真丰盛呢。\n你是用剧场的茶水间做出这些料理吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "4572b50f1265a095aaa25a1677dbee63f860793e9de519675b8087a60108fe9d", "ja": "いえ、『出張！　佐竹飯店』用の設備を使いました。\nやっぱり、鍋は振らなきゃですからね！", "zh": "不是的，我是用『快闪店！佐竹饭店』的设备做的。\n做料理还是得甩甩锅子才有感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "08713ee2e3e166ef15b148897a75db04f49fc5f953aa921d9bae65328d540c45", "ja": "ああ、借りていた設備がまだあったのか。\n今日返すんだったか？", "zh": "这样啊，原来借来的设备还留着。\n是今天要还回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "6e8d42a8d62f5baa8fe5a7bdee918897588e4491374ecce4ad37f444b1cd6e95", "ja": "そうなんです！　だから最後にもう一回、\n思いっきり腕をふるっちゃおうと思いまして！", "zh": "是的！所以我才想说\n最后再尽情展现一下厨艺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "165980003d567a0a63d1d4c888a0a606416e29f4db756a21709399f6e857cae8", "ja": "私、この公演期間、{$P$}さんに、\nたくさんのことを教えてもらいました。", "zh": "在这次公演的期间，\n{$P$}先生教了我很多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "381f19845e41c855bd4ce8bdec257d5f4788fd2409ac771e7de1dcd311cb35bd", "ja": "これは、そのお礼なんです。\nだから遠慮せず、お腹いっぱい食べちゃってください！", "zh": "这顿午饭就是我的回礼。\n所以请你不用客气，尽情吃到饱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1efdc9fa04dfa9b72b18b33602c6d2922633ad279b7040991e385556de316538", "ja": "そうか……ありがとうな、美奈子。\nそれじゃ、遠慮なくいただくよ。", "zh": "原来如此……谢谢你，美奈子。\n那我就不客气，直接开动啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "f2fb0ababb4866a03c662791b084b22bd271359bdad5a33b4824619abb0008fc", "ja": "はい！　でも『出張！　佐竹飯店』が期間限定なのが、\nやっぱり残念なんですよね……。", "zh": "好的！不过『快闪店！佐竹饭店』是期间限定，\n我还是觉得好可惜喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "c564bbd502d23125ba591c4f554134fe3f91c5321e0e56532281279f38fe562d", "ja": "{$P$}さんのカロリー補給、\nこれからどうすればいいんでしょう……。", "zh": "以后要怎么帮{$P$}先生\n补充卡路里呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a66a0af0a56dc20a5abf8033841022b1d90a45c8181653529b6e304efeb1b90f", "ja": "いや、心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。\nそれに、本家の方の佐竹飯店にも寄らせてもらうし。", "zh": "没关系的，不用替我担心啦。\n而且，我以后也会去佐竹饭店的总店吃饭啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "13cc809e3c8537c9aaece46343fe40be0e4e47d6bc7fa339a01aaff60851840d", "ja": "本当ですか！？　わっほーい！\nそれなら安心ですね♪", "zh": "真的吗！？哇哦──！\n那我就放心了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0053_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "8f20872d2fdb80b5048cf0b54343cc4f0bfd251430c2f4a43eec0f7d731aed2b", "ja": "それじゃ、今日のところは……最後の\n『出張！　佐竹飯店』、召し上がってくださいね！", "zh": "那么，今天就……好好享用\n『快闪店！佐竹饭店』的最后一份餐点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
